# Netlify response headers for moderndive.com.

# Course data files are fetched cross-origin by the instructor hub's live
# (webR) slide decks when the hub is viewed on its Netlify origin. They're
# public CSVs, so allow any origin to read them (fixes e.g. the Chapter 4
# "read a CSV off the internet" live-code cell failing CORS on the
# netlify.app origin).
/data/*
  Access-Control-Allow-Origin: *
